# Quake OS continuous improvement

Activate when user says **run quake os**, **continuous improvement**, **keep improving AMS**, or **parallel agents**.

## Runner

`@quake-os-continuous-runner` — reads `data/quake-os/improvement-backlog.json`, runs `pnpm quake:gates`, launches parallel specialists.

## Extended specialists

| Agent | Role |
|-------|------|
| `quake-os-designer` | Visual system, marketing, glass admin |
| `quake-os-ams-specialist` | AMS module depth vs competitors |
| `quake-os-security` | Tenant, caps, audit, SECURE-FORCE |
| `quake-os-scale` | Large data, pagination, indexes |

Plus full roster in `quake-os-orchestrator.mdc`.

## Each wave

1. Gates (`scripts/quake-os-gates.sh`)
2. Pick 1–3 backlog items
3. Parallel build (design + security review in parallel with feature)
4. `quake-os-audit` + `pulse-supervisor`
5. Update backlog + `data/quake-os/waves/`

